# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
# Without this set, the app still runs — AI features (matching
# explanations, translation, the Assistant) will just say they're
# unavailable and fall back to manual use, per the app's own
# "AI failure handling" design.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# A shared passcode for the admin sign-in link (bottom of the sign-in
# page). Without this set, admin sign-in is disabled entirely rather
# than left open. This is a simple shared-passcode scheme suitable for
# a small pilot — replace with real per-person accounts (e.g. Supabase
# Auth with a role column enforced by Row Level Security) before this
# handles real moderation at scale.
ADMIN_PASSCODE=
